{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:0c18d36cb67b4e64","name":"Wrruushi Training","source":{"id":"source:reference-0c18d36cb67b4e64","title":"Wrruushi Training","revision":20998,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:57:58Z","sha256":"f44d4b0f70efc5cdf4148ce321b0c18e7682b11801388f0f4fcc775e1be9d036","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20998","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Wrruushi%20Training&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-0c18d36cb67b4e64","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are trained in the Wrruushi unarmed fighting style of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiees"}," and feel more invigorated in the heat of battle.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiee"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiee","referenceId":"reference:0ac15c44d33f4b95"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Constitution"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Constitution"}," 13, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Martial Arts I"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Martial_Arts_I","referenceId":"reference:e2ebb2bef3706adf"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Effect:"]}," Once per round when you make a successful ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attack"},", you gain a number of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonus Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points"}," equal to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Constitution"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Constitution"}," modifier. Damage is subtracted from the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonus Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points"}," first, and any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonus Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points"}," remaining at the end of the encounter are lost. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bonus Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points"}," do not stack.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, you can make an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attack"}," against an enemy's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"}," instead of the enemy's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},". If the attack is successful, the enemy not only takes damage but also loses any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"}," until the end of the encounter. You must be wearing ",{"tag":"a","children":["Light Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Light_Armor","referenceId":"reference:1b329ddc8a34adfe"}," or no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," to gain the benefits of this feat.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," If you have the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Wrruushi Expertise"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wrruushi_Expertise"}]}," Talent, once per encounter when you score a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Critical Hit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Critical_Hit"}," with an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed_Attack"}," against an enemy, you can deal normal damage and move the target an additional -2 steps down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},", regardless of the damage result. You must be wearing ",{"tag":"a","children":["Light Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Light_Armor","referenceId":"reference:1b329ddc8a34adfe"}," or no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," to gain this special benefit.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
